  "analytical_usefulness": 0.65,
  "source_groundedness": 0.78,
  "rationale": "Most columns offer genuine axes (vertical, business model, geography, strategic role) directly relevant to studying market-expansion focus and are well-grounded in descriptions/addresses. Two columns (expansion_maturity_signal, silicon_valley_ecosystem_position) are near-duplicate restatements of other added columns, dragging holistic usefulness down. Groundedness is generally solid; the main weakness is maturity-stage columns asserting specific stages the text seldom states."
